---
title: "publishSaleResults (LegionSealedBidAuctionSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: check caller is Legion operator
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: not authorized
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_auth --> q_check_locked: authorized
    q_check_locked --> q_check_timing: cancelLocked == true (initializePublishSaleResults called)
    q_check_locked --> q_revert_locked: not initialized for publish
    q_revert_locked --> [*]: revert PublishNotInitialized
    q_check_timing --> q_set_results: refundEndTime < now
    q_check_timing --> q_revert_timing: refund period not ended
    q_revert_timing --> [*]: revert RefundPeriodNotEnded
    q_set_results --> q_set_key: set claimMerkleRoot, acceptedCapitalMerkleRoot, totalTokensAllocated
    q_set_key --> [*]: publish ECIES privateKey for bid decryption, emit ResultsPublished

    note right of q_set_key
        INV-001: privateKey published allows all bids to be decrypted and verified
        INV-002: initializePublishSaleResults must be called first to lock cancellation
        INV-003: results published after refund period ends
        INV-004: bid transparency achieved post-publication via decryptSealedBid
    end note
